tive-conditions.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Degenerative Conditions <\/a>\n<a href=\"https:\/\/23century.my\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/03\/Early-immunotherapy-using-autologous-adult-stem-cells-reversed-the-effect-of-anti-pancreatic-islets-in-recently-diagnosed-type-1-diabetes-mellitus.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Diabetes-1 <\/a>\n<a href=\"https:\/\/23century.my\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/Effectiveness-and-safety-of-human-umbilical-cord-mesenchymal-stem-cells-for-treating-type-2-diabetes-mellitus.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Diabetes-2 <\/a>\n<a href=\"https:\/\/23century.my\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/03\/Human_cord_blood-derived_mononuclear_cell_transpla.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Encephalitis <\/a>\n<a href=\"https:\/\/23century.my\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/03\/Human-umbilical-cord-blood-derived-mononuclear-cell-transplantation-Case-series-of-30-subjects-with-Hereditary-Ataxia.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Hereditary Ataxia <\/a>\n<a href=\"https:\/\/23century.my\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/03\/Mesenchymal-stem-cells-transplantation-for-systemic-lupus.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Lupus Erythematosus-1 <\/a>\n<a href=\"https:\/\/23century.my\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/systematic-lupus-erythematous-1-year-follow-up-lowest-SLE-need-to-put-in-5-years-follow-up.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Lupus Erythematosus-2 <\/a>\n<a href=\"https:\/\/23century.my\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/03\/A-Long-Term-Follow-Up-Study-of-Allogeneic-Mesenchymal-StemStromal-Cell.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Lupus Erythematosus-3 (Long Term) <\/a>\n<a href=\"https:\/\/23century.my\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/DOC-20241102-WA0097.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Memory-Like Natural Killer\u00a0Cells <\/a>\n<a href=\"https:\/\/23century.my\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/03\/Quantitative_assessment_of_gait_and_neurochemical.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Parkins